    <header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">About / Vitor Sacramento</p><h1>Between the physical world and the digital.</h1><p class="lead">My practice connects geological observation, spatial reasoning, data systems and software. The question comes first; the tools follow the problem.</p><a class="text-link" href="#profile">Professional overview ↓</a></header>
